    ReleaseChangelog(version: "3.3.0", markdown: "- **Mentra Call:** Now available on iPhone, with a redesigned call screen and photo sharing during calls.\n- **Microphone:** Improved glasses microphone reliability, including after phone calls.\n- **Photos and gallery:** More reliable photo capture and gallery syncing.\n- **Glasses updates:** More reliable glasses updates, with clearer progress.\n- **Miniapps:** Miniapps now update automatically. Fixed miniapps getting stuck on loading screens.\n- **Mentra AI:** Reliability improvements and bug fixes.\n- **Notes:** Take photos with the glasses camera button, and add meeting and location details to your notes.\n- **Pairing and connections:** Improved glasses audio reconnection on Android.\n- **G1 and NIMO:** Improved text display, including accented letters.\n- **Android tablets:** The Mentra App now rotates to landscape.\n- **Privacy:** Wi-Fi passwords are no longer stored in logs, and data exports no longer include your sign-in token."),
    ReleaseChangelog(version: "3.2.1", markdown: "- **Livestreamer:** \"Stream Here\" now works without a Wi-Fi network. Improved stream startup and connection reliability.\n- **Photos and gallery:** More reliable photo capture and gallery syncing.\n- **Mentra AI:** Reliability improvements and bug fixes.\n- **Miniapps:** Smoother transitions, with back buttons and gestures that take you to the previous screen inside a miniapp.\n- **Pairing and connections:** Improved G1 pairing and G2 background reconnection.\n- **Glasses updates:** Fixed repeated update checks and improved recovery after interrupted updates.\n- **Mentra Maps:** Bug fixes.\n- **NIMO:** Improved text and map layouts.\n- **Self-hosting:** Connect the Mentra App to your own self-hosted Mentra backend."),
    ReleaseChangelog(version: "3.2.0", markdown: "- Improved glasses connectivity and Wi-Fi setup.\n\n- Breaking Bluetooth SDK change: `forgetWifiNetwork(ssid)` now returns `WifiForgetResult` instead of `WifiStatusChangeEvent`. Migrate status-only consumers to the semantic `outcome`; the requested network remains `ssid`, while optional post-command connectivity is reported by `connected`, `currentSsid`, and `localIp`."),
    ReleaseChangelog(version: "3.1.1", markdown: "- Improved Google login on iOS.\n- Pairing no longer requires phone microphone access."),
    ReleaseChangelog(version: "3.1.0", markdown: "**Mentra App and glasses**\n\n- Improved glasses pairing and reconnection, including on iPad.\n- Improved Android background reliability for captions and miniapps.\n- Added Xingyi AR99 support.\n- More reliable photo and video capture, with improved shutter sounds and privacy-light timing. Taking photos no longer interrupts your running miniapp.\n- Added video thumbnails and smoother gallery browsing.\n- Easier Mentra Live updates through your phone, with clearer progress and better recovery from interruptions.\n\n**Miniapp updates**\n\n- **Mentra AI:** Control whether photos are included with questions. Improved visual answers and connected-app follow-ups.\n- **Captions:** Added offline transcription settings and top/bottom positioning on supported displays.\n- **Translation:** Restored all 60 languages.\n- **Mentra Maps:** Clearer directions on G1/G2, less display flickering, and improved Android offline routing.\n- **Livestreamer:** More video-quality controls and custom streaming options, plus improved startup and sharing.\n- **Merge:** Tap to expand an insight; swipe down or back to dismiss it.\n- **Mentra Notes:** Smoother back navigation.\n- **Recorder:** Fixed audio sharing."),
